# The pinned libdatachannel v0.23.2 (usrsctp dep) retains its SCTP send
# buffer when a datachannel open message races connection teardown
# (sctp_copy_it_in <- SctpTransport::trySendMessage). The 368-byte/2-alloc
# window is internal to the third-party stack — Heyaki frames appear only
# as the caller — and is timing-dependent (CI runs 35532962788/35539819653:
# asan green on other runners, failing on the shutdown matrix and m3a).
# Frame-based suppression, narrowly scoped to the usrsctp allocation site;
# Heyaki-owned leaks are NOT covered by this file.
leak:sctp_copy_it_in
